Canonical gates: [`gaia/docs/LIVE-RELAYS.md`](gaia/docs/LIVE-RELAYS.md),
[`atlas/docs/OPERATOR-USE-CASES.md`](atlas/docs/OPERATOR-USE-CASES.md),
[`docs/add-gaia-atlas-sensor.md`](docs/add-gaia-atlas-sensor.md),
[`docs/specs/05a-gnss-pnt-source-quarantine.md`](docs/specs/05a-gnss-pnt-source-quarantine.md).

## Pass bar (all must clear)

1. **Licence** — CC0 / CC BY / OGL / NLOD / U.S. PD / Copernicus CC BY already used in-repo. Fail: NC, BY-NC, “indicative only”, helpdesk-only ToS, raw-data resale ban that blocks Hub SKUs, exchange guidelines that require programme notification / forbid decision-support without a recorded operator assent.
2. **Embed** — HTTPS host on GAIA allowlist; empty/fail → offline; Hub must not debit.
3. **Meaning** — new question **or** new licensed geography (not USGS-as-global under a new name).
4. **Honesty** — warning ≠ in-situ; public AIS ≠ own-edge; Open-Meteo ≠ station; HMS smoke = NA only; etc.

